-Continue for at least 7,200 monotonic seconds; wall-clock timestamps are for
-audit, not the duration calculation. Send traffic every minute with no planned
-gap longer than 90 seconds.
+### Attempt failure rule
 
-Keep one authenticated same-origin capture WS open for the full run. Append
-binary frames to one pcapng file. At elapsed 0, 30, 60, 90, and 120 minutes,
-validate a complete-block snapshot without truncating the live file, record
-bytes/blocks/packets/SHA-256 and the last packet timestamp, and inject a unique
-traffic checkpoint so “still valid” cannot be satisfied by replaying the first
